#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/full_screen.rst:7
msgid "Full screen mode"
msgstr "全屏模式"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/full_screen.rst:9
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the option of displaying full screen. The full screen "
"mode can be selected from `menu bar`_ and using keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "QElectroTech 提供了显示全屏幕的选项。全屏幕模式可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 选择，并使用键盘快捷键 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/full_screen.rst:13
msgid "Full screen mode from menu bar"
msgstr "来自菜单栏的全屏幕模式"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/full_screen.rst:15
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > FullScreen Mode** menu item to display QElectroTech in "
"full screen mode."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > FullScreen Mode** 菜单项以全屏幕模式显示 QElectroTech 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/full_screen.rst:20
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech settings menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 设置菜单"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/full_screen.rst:23
msgid "Full screen mode using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键的全屏幕模式"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/full_screen.rst:25
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/full_screen.rst:27
msgid ""
"Press ``Ctrl + Shift + f`` to display QElectroTech in full screen mode."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + Shift + f`` 在全屏模式下显示QElectroTech."

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/full_screen.rst:31
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/full_screen.rst:35
msgid ""
"To leave full screen mode, select **Settings > Leave FullScreen Mode** menu "
"item or use again ``Ctrl + Shift + f`` keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "要离开全屏模式，请选择 **设置 > 离开全屏模式** 菜单项或再次使用 ``Ctrl + Shift + f`` 键盘快捷键。"
